  "translation": "Kɔngɔ kɛra Dawid (Dawuda) ka sankɔnɔ san saba na, san kɔfɛ san; Dawid ye ⟨את⟩ Yawe ka ɲɛ ɲinini, Yawe ko: O ye Shaul (Sawulu) ni a ka joliw ka so ye, sabu a ye ⟨את⟩ Gibonitew sa-ke.",
